# Cursor Rules

## Project Guidelines

Purpose: This project builds a light web page that will host a single JS-based game.

Building tool: Vite

Agent restrictions:  
-Do not evaluate the /.reference folder.  Exception: if a file is added to chat as context, then evaluate it.  Do not change it.
-Anything listed in the gitignore file should not be changed in this workspace.  It can be evaluated, but not changed.

Language: Use TypeScript for all code when possible.

/site/game folder: Imagine that all core game info and objects are inside of that folder.  It should be easy to simply drop in another game with minimal configuration changes.